It is the data source for the waste authority registry. This repository only
records a commit reference to it — the code itself is neither contained in nor
distributed by this repository, and remains under its own license.

Collection dates are retrieved at runtime from the portals of the respective
German waste authorities. Address resolution uses Nominatim
(https://nominatim.openstreetmap.org/), whose data is © OpenStreetMap
contributors, available under the Open Database License.
